  m_Name: BossOblivion
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: OneMoreKnight::OneMoreKnight.Enemies.BossStats
  maxHealth: 450
  contactDamage: 2
  scoreReward: 8000
  description: The last thing most far runs see. A mask with stars for eyes and nothing
    measurable behind it. The tendrils are not reaching for you; you are simply in
    the direction of everything.
  tactics: Dense rings with aimed spit, then a spiral (Maw, plus Hexblade summons),
    then cross-quads with homing bolts and a Ravager (Oblivion phase). The rings
    are the rhythm section - everything else syncopates around them. Below 30% the
    hover doubles; stop aiming at where it is.
